    summary: "**`morluto/rea`** (Reverse Engineer Anything) is an open-source tool and Model Context Protocol (MCP) analysis engine designed to connect AI coding agents to deep reverse-engineering tools[1][2]. \n\n### Key Features\n* **Agent-Driven Reverse Engineering:** Allows AI coding agents (such as Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Gemini CLI, etc.) to investigate compiled apps, features, or websites without needing the original source code[1][3].\n* **Multi-Environment Inspection:** Provides tools to inspect native binaries, Android APKs, JavaScript and Electron apps, .NET assemblies, and live websites[1][2].\n* **Integration with Native Engines:** Can interface with established reverse engineering frameworks like Hopper, Ghidra, IDA, and Kuna for deep binary analysis (handling architecture targets like Windows ARM PE, raw m68k images, etc.)[1][4].\n* **Evidence-Backed Conclusions:** Runs analysis locally and feeds structured results back to the agent, complete with exact-address cross-references, pseudocode, assembly details, and source evidence[1][4].\n\n### Quick Start & Setup\nYou can set up REA with your agent via Node.js and npm[1]:\n```bash\nnpx rea-agents setup\n```\nThis registers REA\'s MCP server, adds matching workflow instructions to your coding environment, and handles provider configuration[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHsx0bT_OBIGblVAECmirC-YHf5miNAkzexi05-2fT1bx1VNYiM3D34AxdYNfaWCGdMs7GFheGrR_--Dn-cAb_qma0hmsh12Dy41UbeO_vrZpiXAkU=)\n[2] [repowise.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGRRZoyHAJKwk8LxUVPue_Fw-45Oe0MlPgMqBETuoTExzV34-z9yl3ufQ8EmgxbI9xlGXTAkuw4xqncd6p7IWJd5acKPXthf7ro2iGZ96k2aDdodED8ElSycUVY)\n[3] [reddit.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQER4rvoRhYOpL6tZDUdefGxPKTNfGvV2weFUJBP-dJSdwCHc9xys76zy_eE4yce4au9D6PR6WAtdOEpjQIT41vk2zNjhlX5wwH1FZrnnjvatN8JDQAhkIH2Bag1wHQZmn_e0hBnQ25HPNJz3UJR9B3vEAt72uSAhZ_H0hW0ewzDeGqdyz7eudnp0f_6HEVGFAK7bimgxdPTTSH_mpqnpCj2iTA=)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFmyOQZ6R9c6rhpCYkn83jXA-aYisQ9s91p-mU1TOgYK1uGZ5fOiT1bTgijIi4J5t82T_-37FXx5QvN_Kdu_gGZJAt9Abp695rHtoigi__E5F-zhCrHZ1_pe0HEFmE=)"
    third_party_config {
      provider: THIRD_PARTY_WEB_SEARCH_PROVIDER_GEMINI
    }
    search_type: SEARCH_WEB_TYPE_WEB
  }
}
