  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining Public Website**\n\nI\'ve been looking over the `website/public` directory, and it seems the repository `morluto/rea` contains the entire web application for REA. I\'ve spotted `index.html`, which seems to be the interactive homepage, and a specific example in `examples/dino-lab/index.html`. This might be a useful interactive reverse engineering example.\n\n\n**Analyzing Showcase Material**\n\nI\'ve discovered the `website/public/showcase` directory, and it looks like there are a few interesting reverse engineering showcases within. I\'m focusing on Aegis, DX-Ball, CTF, Notion, and TH04 examples. The guide, quick start, and first investigation material are worth a look too. There are a few guides as well as FAQ, contributors, and blog content to consider too!\n\n\n"
