    combined_output {
      full: "<truncated 24 bytes>\ncations on the first main-document CSS match  inspect-web-network-capture             Inspect retained HAR, native mitmproxy, Fiddler SAZ or aioquic qlog records without fetching recorded URLs  inspect-web-page                        Passively inspect one page through CDP, defaulting to its current origin  inspect-with-objdump                    Inspect a local artifact with GNU objdump and retain its raw output as Evidence  install-adb-package                     Install one local APK; --replace requests reinstall mode to keep existing app data  instructions                            Read every raw instruction without decompiling. Supply at least one of the positional address or --procedure. Equal values are accepted; conflicts fail.  instrument-with-frida                   Run one Frida script against a selected process and detach. Provide exactly one of --script or --script-file.  list-adb-devices                        List attached devices with serial, state, transport, and inferred kind  list-adb-directory                      List one device directory with kinds, permissions, and sizes  list-adb-features                       List the device\'s declared hardware and software features  list-adb-packages                       List installed packages on one device with base APK device paths  list-adb-processes                      List running processes exactly as ps -A reports them  list-adb-services                       List the device\'s binder services and interfaces  list-architectures                      Run list_architectures without launching Hopper  list-browser-targets                    List page targets from a selected loopback CDP browser, optionally filtered by origin  list-cutter-sessions                    List live Cutter instances connected through the REA Python plugin bridge  list-electron-targets                   List local file pages exposed by the selected Electron CDP endpoint  list-frida-devices                      List local Frida devices and an optional remote endpoint  list-frida-processes                    List processes visible through a Frida device  list-javascript-runtime-targets         List Node/Electron V8 Inspector targets  list-jeb-units                          List JEB project units by path and type with optional filter  list-objdump-architectures              List BFD targets advertised by the installed GNU objdump  match-native-functions                  Match two observed native function inventories without executing targets  observe-javascript-runtime              Passively observe one exact Node/Electron Inspector target  observe-native-calls                    Launch a Mach-O under LLDB and record entries into selected functions or Objective-C methods  observe-native-ui                       Observe one already-running native application window by PID and window ID  observe-web-execution                   Observe precise page execution; resets counters and temporarily disables optimization  observe-web-session                     Observe user-driven page navigation during a chosen window  open-jeb-project                        Open or create a JEB project from an artifact or .jdb2 database  project-android-application-graph       Project authenticated APK inventory Evidence into an Android application graph  project-apple-application-graph         Project authenticated IPA or macOS app inventory Evidence into an Apple application graph  project-harmony-application-graph       Project authenticated HarmonyOS HAP, HSP, or App Pack inventory Evidence into an application graph  project-managed-application-graph       Project authenticated managed static Evidence into an application graph  providers                               List configured analysis providers  pull-adb-file                           Pull one device file to a local copy with a SHA-256 digest  pull-adb-package                        Pull one installed package\'s complete A