          List local file pages exposed by the selected Electron CDP endpoint  list-frida-devices                      List local Frida devices and an optional remote endpoint  list-frida-processes                    List processes visible through a Frida device  list-javascript-runtime-targets         List Node/Electron V8 Inspector targets  list-jeb-units                          List JEB project units by path and type with optional filter  list-objdump-architectures              List BFD targets advertised by the installed GNU objdump  match-native-functions                  Match two observed native function inventories without executing targets  observe-javascript-runtime              Passively observe one exact Node/Electron Inspector target  observe-native-calls                    Launch a Mach-O under LLDB and record entries into selected functions or Objective-C methods  observe-native-ui                       Observe one already-running native application window by PID and window ID  observe-web-execution                   Observe precise page execution; resets counters and temporarily disables optimization  observe-web-session                     Observe user-driven page navigation during a chosen window  open-jeb-project                        Open or create a JEB project from an artifact or .jdb2 database  project-android-application-graph       Project authenticated APK inventory Evidence into an Android application graph  project-apple-application-graph         Project authenticated IPA or macOS app inventory Evidence into an Apple application graph  project-harmony-application-graph       Project authenticated HarmonyOS HAP, HSP, or App Pack inventory Evidence into an application graph  project-managed-application-graph       Project authenticated managed static Evidence into an application graph  providers                               List configured analysis providers  pull-adb-file                           Pull one device file to a local copy with a SHA-256 digest  pull-adb-package                        Pull one installed package\'s complete APK set with SHA-256 digests  push-adb-file                           Push one local file to the device; refuses existing targets without --overwrite  read-adb-logcat                         Read a bounded dump of the device log for one buffer  read-adb-setting                        Read one settings value from system, secure, or global  read-bytes                              Read exact provider memory bytes at one analysis address  reconcile-javascript-runtime            Reconcile static application and passive runtime Evidence JSON  recover-javascript-sources              Recover readable JavaScript modules with source provenance and verified files  resolve-adb-packages                    Find installed packages by case-insensitive name substring  resolve-native-call-targets             Resolve one static native call site  search                                  Search every analyzed string or procedure name. Supply at least one of the positional pattern or --pattern. Equal values are accepted; conflicts fail.  search-android-classes                  Search APK class names; empty query inventories all classes  search-bytes                            Find masked byte patterns in initialized provider memory  setup                                   Configure agent integrations and optional analysis providers  start-adb-activity                      Start an intent with am start (action, URI, component, extras)  start-adb-app                           Start one installed app by resolving and launching its launcher activity  stop-adb-app                            Force-stop every process of one package  trace                                   Trace a literal feature through analyzed references. Supply at least one of the positional query or --query. Equal values are accepted; conflicts fail.  trace-android-references                Trace incoming APK using nodes for a class or selected method  trace-application-feature               Trace a typed seed through authenticated application Evidence JSON  trace-dylib-resolution                  Trace dyld load-path resolution for a Mach-O or every executable in an app bundle  trace-javascript-semantics              Trace bounded static semantic relations through authenticated application Evidence  trace-native-ui-action                  Trace a compiled UI action selector to its native handler and direct callees  trace-native-values                     Trace bounded native def-use and call dependencies  trace-web-module-imports                Trace one captured script\'s native imports to URLs and captured source candidates  trace-web-source-location               Trace one retained script position through an explicitly selected local source map  uninstall                               Remove REA-owned agent configuration and skill files  uninstall-adb-package                   Uninstall one package and its data from the device  update                                  Update this REA installation and verify the installed release  verify-managed-native-boundaries        Verify managed P/Invoke declarations against authenticated native Evidence  xrefs                                   List bounded references to an analyzed address. Supply at least one of the positional address or --address. Equal values are accepted; conflicts fail.Integrations:  completions  Generate shell completion script  mcp          Register as MCP server (add, doctor)Global Options:  --filter-output <keys>              Filter output by key paths (e.g. foo,bar.baz,a[0,3])  --format <toon|json|yaml|md|jsonl>  Output format  --full-output                       Show full output envelope  --help                              Show help  --llms, --llms-full                 Print LLM-readable manifest  --mcp                               Start as MCP stdio server  --schema                            Show JSON Schema for c