  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing HTML Sync**\n\nI\'m currently updating `/index.html` to ensure the title and meta description are in sync. The plan is to reflect \"Stream+ Video Chat \342\200\224 Free Random Cam Chat Alternative\" in the title and ensure the meta description accurately reflects the free random video chat alternative concept.\n\n\n**Defining Project Architecture**\n\nI\'m solidifying the architecture. Stream+ will be a React SPA, leveraging React 19, Tailwind CSS 4, and more, with a full-stack Express API backend. It will render into `#root`. I\'m starting to visualize the core video stage: `VideoContainer.tsx`, with `RemoteVideo.tsx` for partner interaction, including TV static and avatar options. I\'m focusing on \"Connecting...\" and country flag status overlays too.\n\n\n**Visualizing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into the UI components. I\'ve sketched the \"VideoContainer.tsx\" and its child `RemoteVideo.tsx`, including partner interaction elements like TV static and country flags. I\'m building out `LocalVideo.tsx`, which handles the local webcam feed and simulated avatar for camera status. I\'m adding controls for mute, video, background options, camera switching, fullscreen, and settings. Finally, the \"ControlsDock.tsx\" with its OmeTV-style buttons is also under way.\n\n\n**Designing Chat Interactions**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the design of interactive text chat (`ChatBox.tsx`). A prominent safety banner will greet users. The messages stream will display system events, user messages with timestamps, and stranger responses that use dynamic realistic conversational AI. I\'m focusing on quick action prompt chips to encourage initial interactions, along with the user input bar. The `Next \342\236\224` button has been added, and the `Stop` button has been added too. The country selector and \"I am\" identity selector have been added too.\n\n\n**Adding UI Refinements**\n\nI\'m now integrating an emoji picker drawer with smileys, gestures, and party emojis, alongside a send button for text messages. I\'ve also implemented a translation toggle for auto-translating stranger messages into English. Next, I am working on the header bar, and will soon move on to the rules and report modal.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_912222"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * Pure logic for Stream+ video chat matching, country filtering,\\n * chat bot / stranger simulation, and keyboard shortcut mapping.\\n */\\n\\nexport interface CountryInfo {\\n  code: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  flag: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const COUNTRIES: CountryInfo[] = [\\n  { code: \'ALL\', name: \'All countries\', flag: \'\360\237\214\220\' },\\n  { code: \'US\', name: \'United States\', flag: \'\360\237\207\272\360\237\207\270\' },\\n  { code: \'GB\', name: \'United Kingdom\', flag: \'\360\237\207\254\360\237\207\247\' },\\n  { code: \'CA\', name: \'Canada\', flag: \'\360\237\207\250\360\237\207\246\' },\\n  { code: \'DE\', name: \'Germany\', flag: \'\360\237\207\251\360\237\207\252\' },\\n  { code: \'FR\', name: \'France\', flag: \'\360\237\207\253\360\237\207\267\' },\\n  { code: \'JP\', name: \'Japan\', flag: \'\360\237\207\257\360\237\207\265\' },\\n  { code: \'KR\', name: \'South Korea\', flag: \'\360\237\207\260\360\237\207\267\' },\\n  { code: \'BR\', name: \'Brazil\', flag: \'\360\237\207\247\360\237\207\267\' },\\n  { code: \'IN\', name: \'India\', flag: \'\360\237\207\256\360\237\207\263\' },\\n  { code: \'IT\', name: \'Italy\', flag: \'\360\237\207\256\360\237\207\271\' },\\n  { code: \'ES\', name: \'Spain\', flag: \'\360\237\207\252\360\237\207\270\' },\\n  { code: \'MX\', name: \'Mexico\', flag: \'\360\237\207\262\360\237\207\275\' },\\n  { code: \'AU\', name: \'Australia\', flag: \'\360\237\207\246\360\237\207\272\' },\\n  { code: \'NL\', name: \'Netherlands\', flag: \'\360\237\207\263\360\237\207\261\' },\\n  { code: \'SE\', name: \'Sweden\', flag: \'\360\237\207\270\360\237\207\252\' },\\n  { code: \'TR\', name: \'Turkey\', flag: \'\360\237\207\271\360\237\207\267\' },\\n  { code: \'PL\', name: \'Poland\', flag: \'\360\237\207\265\360\237\207\261\' },\\n  { code: \'UA\', name: \'Ukraine\', flag: \'\360\237\207\272\360\237\207\246\' },\\n];\\n\\nexport interface StrangerProfile {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  country: string;\\n  flag: string;\\n  age: number;\\n  gender: \'female\' | \'male\';\\n  videoStyle: \'sunny_room\' | \'cozy_bedroom\' | \'neon_studio\' | \'outdoor_cafe\' | \'gamer_setup\';\\n  greetings: string[];\\n  replies: Record<string, string>;\\n  defaultReplies: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport const STRANGER_PROFILES: StrangerProfile[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'s1\',\\n    name: \'Elena\',\\n    country: \'Spain\',\\n    flag: \'\360\237\207\252\360\237\207\270\',\\n    age: 21,\\n    gender: \'female\',\\n    videoStyle: \'sunny_room\',\\n    greetings: [\'\302\241Hola! How is it going?\', \'Hey there! \360\237\230\212\', \'Hello! Where are you from?\'],\\n    replies: {\\n      hi: \'Hey! Nice to meet you!\',\\n      hello: \'Hello! Having a good day?\',\\n      where: \\\"I\'m in Barcelona! It\'s so sunny today.\\\",\\n      music: \'I love indie pop and techno. You?\',\\n      gamer: \'A bit! I play Valorant on weekends haha.\',\\n    },\\n    defaultReplies: [\'Haha totally!\', \'Cool shirt by the way.\', \'That sounds nice!\', \'Really? Tell me more!\'],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'s2\',\\n    name: \'Kenji\',\\n    country: \'Japan\',\\n    flag: \'\360\237\207\257\360\237\207\265\',\\n    age: 24,\\n    gender: \'male\',\\n    videoStyle: \'neon_studio\',\\n    greetings: [\'Konnichiwa! Hello!\', \'Hey! Nice camera quality.\', \'Hi from Tokyo! \360\237\227\274\'],\\n    replies: {\\n      hi: \'Hey! Tokyo is lively tonight!\',\\n      hello: \'Konbanwa! What time is it for you?\',\\n      where: \\\"I\'m from Tokyo, Japan! Have you ever visited?\\\",\\n      music: \'J-Rock and synthwave! You?\',\\n      gamer: \'Yes! Huge fan of Elden Ring and Nintendo games.\',\\n    },\\n    defaultReplies: [\'Awesome!\', \'Haha yeah!\', \'Super cool to meet you here.\', \'Stream+ is pretty fast today.\'],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'s3\',\\n    name: \'Sarah\',\\n    country: \'United States\',\\n    flag: \'\360\237\207\272\360\237\207\270\',\\n    age: 22,\\n    gender: \'female\',\\n    videoStyle: \'cozy_bedroom\',\\n    greetings: [\'Hey! What\342\200\231s up?\', \'Hello! Hope you are having a chill evening \342\234\250\', \'Hi from California!\'],\\n    replies: {\\n      hi: \'Hey! What are you up to today?\',\\n      hello: \'Hi! Just studying and chatting on Stream+ haha.\',\\n      where: \'I am in Los Angeles, California! Where are you?\',\\n      music: \'Billie Eilish, Sabrina Carpenter, and retro R&B.\',\\n      gamer: \'I play Animal Crossing and Minecraft mostly!\',\\n    },\\n    defaultReplies: [\'No way haha!\', \'That\342\200\231s awesome!\', \'Totally agree.\', \'You seem really nice!\'],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'s4\',\\n    name: \'Lucas\',\\n    country: \'Germany\',\\n    flag: \'\360\237\207\251\360\237\207\252\',\\n    age: 25,\\n    gender: \'male\',\\n    videoStyle: \'gamer_setup\',\\n    greetings: [\'Hallo! How are you?\', \'Hey! Nice to connect.\', \'Servus from Munich! \360\237\215\272\'],\\n    replies: {\\n      hi: \'Hi there! Everything good?\',\\n      hello: \'Hallo! How is your day going?\',\\n      where: \'Munich, Germany! Beautiful weather today.\',\\n      music: \'Electronic music and classic rock.\',\\n      gamer: \'Yeah, Counter-Strike and Apex Legends!\',\\n    },\\n    defaultReplies: [\'Das ist gut!\', \'Interesting!\', \'Haha yep!\', \'Have a great day!\'],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'s5\',\\n    name: \'Chloe\',\\n    country: \'United Kingdom\',\\n    flag: \'\360\237\207\254\360\237\207\247\',\\n    age: 23,\\n    gender: \'female\',\\n    videoStyle: \'outdoor_cafe\',\\n    greetings: [\'Cheers! How are you doing?\', \'Hey! Lovely to meet you.\', \'Hello from London! \342\230\225\'],\\n    replies: {\\n      hi: \'Hello there! All good?\',\\n      hello: \'Hi! Tea time in London right now haha.\',\\n      where: \'London, UK! Rainy as usual \360\237\214\247\357\270\217\',\\n      music: \'Oasis, Arctic Monkeys, and Dua Lipa.\',\\n      gamer: \'Not huge, but I love Mario Kart with friends.\',\\n    },\\n    defaultReplies: [\'Brilliant!\', \'Haha lovely!\', \'Spot on.\', \'Cheers mate!\'],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\n/**\\n * Filter countries by search term.\\n */\\nexport function filterCountries(countries: CountryInfo[], searchTerm: string): CountryInfo[] {\\n  const term = searchTerm.trim().toLowerCase();\\n  if (!term) return countries;\\n  return countries.filter(\\n    (c) => c.name.toLowerCase().includes(term) || c.code.toLowerCase().includes(term)\\n  );\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Pick a stranger profile matching country filter (or random if ALL).\\n */\\nexport function pickStranger(selectedCountryCode: string, excludeId?: string): StrangerProfile {\\n  let pool = STRANGER_PROFILES;\\n  if (selectedCountryCode && selectedCountryCode !== \'ALL\') {\\n    const matched = STRANGER_PROFILES.filter((s) => {\\n      const countryObj = COUNTRIES.find((c) => c.code === selectedCountryCode);\\n      return countryObj && s.country.toLowerCase() === countryObj.name.toLowerCase();\\n    });\\n    if (matched.length > 0) {\\n      pool = matched;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const filtered = pool.filter((s) => s.id !== excludeId);\\n  const candidates = filtered.length > 0 ? filtered : pool;\\n  const index = Math.floor(Math.random() * candidates.length);\\n  return candidates[index];\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Get intelligent automated reply from stranger based on user message.\\n */\\nexport function getStrangerReply(stranger: StrangerProfile, userMessage: string): string {\\n  const lower = userMessage.toLowerCase();\\n  for (const [key, reply] of Object.entries(stranger.replies)) {\\n    if (lower.includes(key)) {\\n      return reply;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  const randomDefault = stranger.defaultReplies[Math.floor(Math.random() * stranger.defaultReplies.length)];\\n  return randomDefault;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Format timestamp for chat messages (e.g. \\\"10:14 AM\\\").\\n */\\nexport function formatMessageTime(date: Date = new Date()): string {\\n  return date.toLocaleTimeString([], { hour: \'2-digit\', minute: \'2-digit\' });\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Validate chat message content (trims and checks length).\\n */\\nexport function validateChatMessage(text: string): { valid: boolean; cleaned: string } {\\n  const cleaned = text.trim();\\n  if (!cleaned || cleaned.length === 0 || cleaned.length > 500) {\\n    return { valid: false, cleaned: \'\' };\\n  }\\n  return { valid: true, cleaned };\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create pure logic for Stream+ matching, country filtering, chat response and validation\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/utils/streamLogic.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating streamLogic.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Stream+ pure logic module\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\316-\n\313-\001i\024}\023rqN\t\006\263qv^\307\353\020{\3777\302K\204\372\320\303\271\037W\335\376O\353\341\307SP\254\326\345\263C\341\262\253\260\367\230\323\242YA\364\n\023\351\272\306\202\325TZ8T>w\025\225)tCO=\rm\301\034\236\027\2257e\v.\"\aB\216\340\023\203\365\306\"\t\325\216\314\263\336\200\352\335v\250%\033\257\001\373\262f\242V\025\253\"O\267=\035j\327\034\f\226\025\300\"\340\343\204\276I\214\226\242\343\324\223\004\325\370R\375]\312\1770%\216\b\344\000N2\371\356r\365\377\301\376\314\266\315\327N\035\003b\025\206f\221pw\326SR\235\277\016CS\336\261\332\244^>>zV\031U\244k/\353\327BgZ\177}\260y\337\260\037\\\242>\312R\323O\224u;\vs\002z\227;\310$\243\347\027\356\022\002\344\2656\036\363\370\372\233}V\266*E\345\246\302gn\271P\337\357\025:>\376WK\207\256\374\017&\026\327\207\375S+\270Fa\327M\341x_\373\036&;\"\214\022\thd\360\324\265|<*\312\252\361\002pn\266\325Oj\235\203\207\346r\371\314y\vz\340iD\033\307\f\031\210J\r\2357H\232F\361)\v]]\355wc>\033\354&I\236\347C\221`SU0_\244+\2709L_\326\000\000\221!\3132\343O\r\0337\272w\373|\237\253\276\002\205\025\252\266~\347c\23485\3130\235\215\303\f\3525\242Mk\335\'\275\aJx\240\037\032PW\223\364\300\021\206]\343\321\244R\262\343\2255\212GR85\017\225\242\030\254\317F$\260S\020q\254g\323\201\242cc\372q\355\324\006+\214|\220\324,\373\005\326\367\273\313\225V\3144\315b\235\371\262\243O\362oz|.f\335xb\235\2140\221<@_g\232\320K\263\215\312\223\245n\267\376\037\245?\351\275\371\001\2174!\375\232\272\360\323\242\213o\212\270\355\317\226\005@)V\345\267\000\260\336,\\F\363\203O\201w\036\362\377x\302O\273+\274\373\200Ot\263t0\244J\253\336:\203)\236B\314\266\314\255M\326 \025\352\202e\267/\257\354@U\251\220\213\243Mj?T\vi|MR;\ta#U\')%\272eC\242\320C\212\363\317\350\251\311\300\"\a\3756\314\232n]\336\334\331\334\331@\251\201/n\023I\320\220\\\016\305\037\213\031;\340\375M\240\307E%L\037\223?J\003t\233\353G\3738Ko\373\242\206\257]\335\361\363\271\2313\307\304Q\344\220\317\226)\336\303r\253I\254\033u\023\305\262\313\223\304\321\334\256f\v\0036\236\214w\325\221,\3742S3\276`\275\357t;!\203\365\031\371~\307\035X&\'A\"\272\341K\316\302L\327\251\255\005\246^\"\300\366W\0348\331\t\r\372(\227\204\353\222\3109=L\341^\360\031\021i\373\016\325nP\022)C\325.\215\224}\321\334\335\315\216\226\265\346\356\315w\332\367\204\277\005DC\365L\201\225\2432\325fZ\000\374\006\201j\031\334\242\241J\220l\243\252v[\345k?\367\245\307\367T\224t\343\360\342\373\216\236\335\230\203\340M[_\032\3564m\\\211\2441,\343d\032,\214\270K\237\a\021\266w\207\236\005\257\322\216\316\235\211\333r\216\343\260Z \220iq\016/B\002*b\226\001\2506\356g\210\322\257\241/:\rl\204\206.\211+\251\314v,\032\243\005O\221!\025\026=\v\323\336D\230\240\025\300\376\v\227?f$.\260@\316\036\307\323\3051f\000\316\304\n\227\333M\245\032\307\003\213i]\031\3572\033\332/\343\005\253\002\226\025\204\017\020\205\034\262\336\355|\016p\333\033\376&\264\347\344\t\240u\020\275H;\325\362\3359h\251\207z\3111*\232%\030\ra\035\256\361 \343QO\236\230N\355\005\333\350\371=\253\031\003c\26052\362\333\262ZQ,\023A3\273euMm:f\254\271c\330\303\000h|T\332\016\264\2327\222\025\177\020\271%[|0\246\231C\241\202\025\202\360\367\232\220\2653\235\211\373\271p\333\202F_\271\346\327\fC\220`\3531\020c\001\023\232\225d\253qD\213\024D\312\002\v)0\0021\204Eq=\274}\330\315\373\231\025\227\223\t\004p>\255\025\325\372\365\376\003\004\021\016\343\203\214($:\355\315%\370\370\226xJi\363pF=o~\020\016-\214\305\205\032Q\377\342\017c\002\021\3261`W\233F\376qQ_q\027\016\341\274\234\v\303u\027\354\364\352\336\236EG\370W\215@1eEL\332\330\364\033\263F\341\320i,\212\224\355\236\235^w\252\271\tZ%x\335T\263\b\370\004\273\220\003\256\247S\361\033\274\203\236\355v\305Lz\000\034\262\\~\266\215\352u\210\252\314\232\334\262\305\341\274\004\3421H\375O\317\224+\272of\216#\223)\024\226[\017\372\307\017\223\255\nL\206\356\205\226\245\250\337y\350D:;\325C\367\372\200 a\035\305XP\327{\327\027\345\rr\313\377z\245\276\3330\020h[rZf\304\227\225\204\323_\373\000\024A3\337w\227\316\242\000\267pt@T\25