  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Server Functionality**\n\nI\'m now diving into `server.ts`. My focus is ensuring it correctly manages both API routes and serves the Vite application, whether in development or production. I\'m examining the `express` import and path configuration, ensuring a proper balance.\n\n\n**Examining Code Structure**\n\nI\'ve been looking over the code, specifically at the imports and how paths are handled with `path` and `fileURLToPath`. Now I am looking at how `express` is used to create the app and set the port. The API endpoints for health and stats are clear. I\'m checking the `isProduction` flag and the conditional logic around Vite server usage.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1061612"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import express, { Request, Response } from \'express\';\\nimport path from \'path\';\\nimport fs from \'fs\';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from \'url\';\\n\\nconst __filename = fileURLToPath(import.meta.url);\\nconst __dirname = path.dirname(__filename);\\n\\nconst app = express();\\nconst PORT = Number(process.env.PORT) || 3000;\\n\\napp.use(express.json());\\n\\n// API: Health status\\napp.get(\'/api/health\', (_req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  res.json({\\n    status: \'ok\',\\n    app: \'Stream+ Video Chat\',\\n    version: \'1.0.0\',\\n    onlineUsers: 412890,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// API: Live Stream+ statistics\\napp.get(\'/api/stats\', (_req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  res.json({\\n    online: 412890 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 50) - 25,\\n    activeCalls: 194820,\\n    countriesOnline: 184,\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n// Full-stack Vite middlewares integration\\nconst isProduction = process.env.NODE_ENV === \'production\';\\n\\nif (!isProduction) {\\n  const { createServer: createViteServer } = await import(\'vite\');\\n  const vite = await createViteServer({\\n    server: { middlewareMode: true },\\n    appType: \'spa\',\\n  });\\n  app.use(vite.middlewares);\\n} else {\\n  const distPath = path.join(__dirname, \'dist\');\\n  if (fs.existsSync(distPath)) {\\n    app.use(express.static(distPath));\\n    app.get(\'*\', (_req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n      res.sendFile(path.join(distPath, \'index.html\'));\\n    });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\napp.listen(PORT, \'0.0.0.0\', () => {\\n  console.log(`Stream+ Server running at http://0.0.0.0:${PORT}`);\\n});\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update server.ts with Stream+ endpoints and mounted Vite middleware\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing server.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update server.ts with Stream+ endpoints\"}"
