    thinking: "**Optimizing Screenshot Stability**\n\nI\'ve realized that continuously running `requestAnimationFrame` to stabilize screenshots is inefficient. Playwright\'s `page.screenshot` waits anyway. Now, I\'m thinking of reducing the frame rate to ~10-15fps or introducing static noise frames on status changes and intervals, using `setInterval` for these noise drawings, instead.\n\n\n"
